==Russian==
[[File:PalmercarpenterA.jpg|thumb|Рабочий]]

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|ru|рабо́чій||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*orboťь|}}, from {{m|sla-pro|*orbota|}} + {{m|sla-pro|*-jь|}}. {{surf|ru|рабо́та|-ий}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|рабо́чий}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-рабочий.ogg}}

===Adjective===
{{ru-adj|рабо́чий}}

# {{lb|ru|relational}} [[worker]]; [[worker]]'s {{gl|relating to people who perform physical labor for hire, especially in industry, construction, etc.}}
#: {{coi|ru|'''рабо́чий''' посёлок|'''workers'''' settlement}}
# {{lb|ru|relational}} [[work]], [[working]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''рабо́чая''' [[оде́жда]]|'''work''' clothes}}
# {{lb|ru|relational}} [[labor]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''рабо́чая''' [[си́ла]]|[[manpower|'''man'''power]]}}
# [[working]], [[functioning]] {{gloss|of a device, machine, etc.}}; [[viable]], [[feasible]] {{gloss|of a plan, proposal, etc.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[э́тот]] [[план]] [[вро́де]] [[вполне́]] '''рабо́чий'''|this plan seems quite '''feasible'''}}
# [[preliminary]], [[working]], [[draft]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''рабо́чий''' [[вариа́нт]] [[текст|те́кста]]|'''working''' version of the text}}

